OL,3,AHow important are Nvidia and Jensen    
OL,4,AHuang to the US economy?               
OL,6,FThat central position prompted         
OL,7,Fquestions, in the aftermath of Huang's 
OL,8,Fdeparture over revelations of          
OL,9,Fextramarital affairs, over how         
OL,10,Fimportant he was to the wider AI       
OL,11,Findustry and US economy.               
OL,13,FThe fact he has been handed his job    
OL,14,Fback after just 11 days in a U-turn by 
OL,15,FNvidia's board implies the top brass   
OL,16,Fbelieve Huang is irreplaceable.        
